          "text": "$x_{\\max} = v_0\\sqrt{m/k} = 3\\sqrt{2/200} = 0{,}3$ м."
        },
        {
          "title": "Ответ",
          "text": "Сжатие 30 см.",
          "math": "$$\\boxed{x_{\\max} = 0{,}3 \\text{ м}}$$"
        }
